# That read adds ##contig lines for chromosomes 1 through 10. The source VCF header has none.
# bcftools view without --no-version embeds Date= in the header, so every view below passes --no-version.
# A BCF CSI has l_aux 0 and stores no contig names. Names for a BCF come from the header.
# Wheat chr6D is in the BCF header, in neither index -s table, and not in the VCF CSI name list.
# The tutorial VCF CSI depth is 8. The tutorial BCF CSI depth is 6. Readers take depth from the file.
